{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15304240","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15304240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1530424001:1":{"text":"저희 아이인 레드이어입니다. 이 나무 아래에 묻혀있지요.","source_cn":"我的孩子，红耳。她被埋在这棵树下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2201099BD25AFBFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530424002:1":{"text":"전장에서 죽었는데, 죽기 전에 털 없는 원숭이를 여섯이나 죽였습니다.","source_cn":"她死在战场上，死之前还杀了六个没毛的猿人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC614AF5A62D18281","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530424003:1":{"text":"정말 뛰어난 전사였어요... 정말 자랑스러워요.","source_cn":"她是一个不折不扣的战士……我为她骄傲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62BF307EACBAB603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士兴":{"text":"전사 싱","source":"战士兴","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}